      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_01",
          "content": "了解别人以前是怎样面对情绪的，会让我感觉好一些。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_02",
          "content": "心情低落时，别人提醒我事情或许没有看起来那么糟，会帮助我缓过来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_03",
          "content": "非常高兴、想分享快乐的时候，我喜欢和其他人待在一起。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_04",
          "content": "情绪不好的时候，我会寻找愿意理解和关怀我的人。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_05",
          "content": "感到担忧时，听一听别人对如何处理事情的看法会帮助我。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_06",
          "content": "特别开心的时候，和某些人在一起会让我感觉更愉快。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_07",
          "content": "难受时，如果有人提醒我还有人处境更艰难，我会得到一些宽慰。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_08",
          "content": "心情不错时，我喜欢和其他人待在一起，因为那会让我感觉更开心。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_09",
          "content": "情绪低落时，我常常会去找愿意表达同情和理解的人。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_10",
          "content": "不开心时，别人提醒我情况原本可能更糟，会让我感觉好些。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_11",
          "content": "感到挫折时，了解别人会怎样处理相同处境，对我有帮助。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_12",
          "content": "心里难受时，我会向其他人寻求安慰。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_13",
          "content": "因为快乐可以相互感染，所以我开心时会主动去找别人。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_14",
          "content": "感到烦躁时，别人劝我别太担心，能够帮助我平静下来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_15",
          "content": "难过时，听别人讲述他们怎样面对类似感受，对我有帮助。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 14,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_16",
          "content": "心情非常低落时，我会去找人，希望确认自己是被爱着的。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 15,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_17",
          "content": "焦虑时，别人告诉我不必过于担心，会让我慢慢平静下来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 16,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_18",
          "content": "特别兴奋和高兴时，我会去找其他人，也希望把快乐带给他们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 17,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_19",
          "content": "悲伤时，我会找人寻求宽慰。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 18,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "IERQ20_20",
          "content": "心情不好时，我想知道别人处在我的情境里会怎么做。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 19,
          "responseSetKey": "ierq_degree_true_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
